When you turn into a Deeprock elemental your Nature damage is increased by [20%, 26%, 30%, 33%, 36% (TL1-5; STR 100; SP 100)], Nature damage penetration by [5.9%, 7.9%, 9.3%, 11%, 12% (TL1-5)] and you gain the power to throw boulders:

Effective talent level: [2.0, 4.0, 6.0, 8.0, 10 (TL1-5)]

Use mode: Activated

Equilibrium cost: 5

Range: 10

Cooldown: 3

Travel Speed: instantaneous

Usage Speed: Standard (100% of a turn)

Is: a nature gift

Description: Throw a huge boulder, dealing [170, 236, 286, 328, 366 (TL1-5; STR 100; SP 100)] physical damage and knocking targets back [5, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] tiles within radius 1.

The damage will increase with your Strength.
